---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Compare two reports: new, fixed and unchanged findings, coverage and assertion changes

Usage: rustman report diff [OPTIONS] <OLD> <NEW>

Arguments:
  <OLD>
          The earlier JSON report

  <NEW>
          The later JSON report

Options:
      --fail-on <SEVERITY>
          Exit 1 when a new finding is at or above this severity
          
          [default: high]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: markdown]
          [possible values: markdown, json]

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
